  "en": {
    "title": "Mobile Agent decisions: read first, then confirm",
    "lead": "Yihu PM Radar reads your own JSON export or compatible HTTPS ledger feed and filters items per workbench. Seeing a task does not authorize a reply or prove execution. Two synthetic records illustrate filters, source freshness, phone confirmation and receipts. Watch is a paired-iPhone companion, not an independent approval endpoint.",
    "nav": "Mobile decisions guide navigation",
    "exampleTitle": "Minimal synthetic JSON, not a live service",
    "exampleIntro": "This example has two synthetic items in project demo. example.invalid is not a service endpoint; reply_supported=false marks the sample as not supporting replies and does not replace server authorization. date_str is a fixed demonstration time, not refreshed with the website clock. A later import may appear stale; do not relabel it as live data. Never publish private ledger data or credential-bearing feeds.",
    "exampleDetails": "date_str, decisions, active, stale and cold are snapshot fields. tasks repeats the two records so this example has an explicit full-task collection rather than a legacy incomplete-ledger notice. Raw status values remain 等你决策 / 等你验收; translating display prose must not invent source statuses. There are no tokens, accounts, real items or writable services here.",
