    "stateNote": "This guide supplies no write-enabling command or real reply endpoint and does not operate a service. Request/receipt guards are not an end-to-end exactly-once guarantee; actual device/service replies still need their original acceptance. [R3][R5][R6]",
    "watchTitle": "Watch and notifications: prerequisites before promises",
    "watch": [
